  "cited_article_id": "search-update-pharmacy-directory",
  "reply": "Go to **Patients > Chart > Demographics** and open the **Pharmacy** tab. Click **Search Directory** and look up the new pharmacy by name, NPI, or zip code. If it doesn’t appear, click **Add Custom Pharmacy**, fill in Name, Address, Phone, and Fax, then **Save Entry**. After the entry is saved, select it from the results and click **Set as Preferred**. (Only Medical Assistant or Provider roles can make these changes.)"
}
